00:06:22.929 --> 00:06:28.569
And we will have certainly in the next 72
hours, a lot more information about whether

00:06:28.569 --> 00:06:33.550
we can cross some of these possibilities off
the list or whether they are a likely or realistic

00:06:33.550 --> 00:06:34.979
hypotheses.

